  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together sesame oil, soy sauce, rice vinegar, honey, ginger, and garlic.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated chicken onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill the chicken for 5-7 minutes per side, or until charred and cooked through.",
    "While the chicken is cooking, prepare the pickled ginger and scallions.",
    "Once the chicken is cooked, brush with additional sesame oil and sprinkle with sesame seeds.",
    "Serve the chicken yakitori hot, garnished with pickled ginger and scallions."
